  "created": "2026-06-24",
  "description": "The full sequence of clothing a forwarded book in pared leather, from preparing the back through covering, shaping the caps and corners, and finishing the inside of the boards, leaving the volume ready for decoration.",
  "emitter": "opg://commons-seed",
  "id": "covering-in-leather-seed",
